WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.352 --> 00:00:12.941
(record scratching)

00:00:12.941 --> 00:00:13.774
(classical music)
- You have to take

00:00:13.774 --> 00:00:18.666
into account, guys, that we're
using very thick tipped pens.

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:19.920
(Emma snorts)

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.220
So it is just a little bit
harder to get the nuance

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.100
and detail that I would usually achieve

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.383
if I was with my pencil set.
- (laughs) You're making

00:00:26.383 --> 00:00:28.049
me laugh.

00:00:28.049 --> 00:00:29.080
(bell dings)

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.380
- We're going to draw each other.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.383
Fun little activity.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:35.670
- We're gonna draw each other for Netflix.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.230
Watch "Sex Education."

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.490
So let's just get it going.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:39.323
- [Asa] Let's just go.

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:40.750
- [Ncuti] Let's just get it going.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:41.920
- Pressure is immense.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:42.913
- It's tremendous.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.213
- I'm actually quite stressed.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:50.783
- Can't be rubbing out already.

00:00:50.783 --> 00:00:53.496
- Yeah, me too.
- I'm not looking.

00:00:53.496 --> 00:00:54.645
(Kedar scoffs)

00:00:54.645 --> 00:00:55.478
(Connor groans)

00:00:55.478 --> 00:00:56.811
- [Kedar] Innit.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.880
- Aw, this is quite actually hard,

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.500
this is stressful.
- Don't stress!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.683
- Aw, I don't like my lines.

00:01:04.599 --> 00:01:06.228
- Your hair is gorgeous.

00:01:06.228 --> 00:01:07.311
- Oh, thanks.

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:10.179
Took about three hours.

00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:11.788
(Patricia chuckles)

00:01:11.788 --> 00:01:13.120
What would you do if I turned it round

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.539
and it was just like a picture of a sheep?

00:01:14.539 --> 00:01:15.806
(sheep bleating)

00:01:15.806 --> 00:01:16.770
- Are you doing caricatures or you,

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:17.860
oh there you go, now you wanna look.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.116
You've forgotten how I
look, is that how it is?

00:01:19.116 --> 00:01:20.637
- Ah, ah.

00:01:20.637 --> 00:01:22.960
I'm gonna do it pretty realistic,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:24.023
it's gonna be pretty spot on--

00:01:24.023 --> 00:01:25.524
- You say that, and that
means you're gonna draw

00:01:25.524 --> 00:01:27.067
some sort of fucking,

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.113
I don't know, I don't want to say it.

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:32.324
- I'm wanna get the strength of jaw in.

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:36.566
- (laughs) The strength of jaw.

00:01:36.566 --> 00:01:41.566
Can get the strength, it's
quite easy, just draw a square.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:45.530
- (laughs) I'm stressed.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:47.120
- Oh my god, I've drawn Steve Harrington!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:47.953
- [Emma] Stop it!

00:01:47.953 --> 00:01:48.786
- I have!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.380
- I expect something nice, Ncuti.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:53.213
- Okay, do you know what?

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.260
I'm just gonna do a--

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.290
- Just draw from your heart.

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:56.123
- I'm gonna start--

00:01:56.123 --> 00:01:58.360
- Don't even look at me,
just draw from your heart.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.193
- Do you reckon?

00:01:59.193 --> 00:02:00.026
- Yeah.
- Okay.

00:02:00.026 --> 00:02:02.473
- [Asa] Them nice lips.

00:02:02.473 --> 00:02:03.470
(bell dings)

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:04.820
- Actually, once you start.

00:02:07.201 --> 00:02:08.531
- You promise you're
still gonna be my friend?

00:02:08.531 --> 00:02:10.240
- Oh my god, I was just about
to say exactly the same thing!

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.273
I'm not even joking.

00:02:12.523 --> 00:02:13.356
- Ready?

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:16.780
- Who do we show first?

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.910
The camera?

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.270
You saw.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.583
- But I don't have my glasses on.

00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:22.550
- Three.

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:23.500
- [Ncuti] Two, one.

00:02:26.475 --> 00:02:29.142
(both laughing)

00:02:30.961 --> 00:02:32.327
- That's actually really good.

00:02:32.327 --> 00:02:34.430
Should we sign them or what?

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:37.430
- Yeah, sign it.
- Should we sign it?

00:02:39.156 --> 00:02:41.394
(Emma laughs)

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.810
- It's Steve Harrington.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.810
That's good!

00:02:46.123 --> 00:02:47.142
- It's not.

00:02:47.142 --> 00:02:49.797
This is, (laughs) this is.

00:02:49.797 --> 00:02:50.920
But do you know what I appreciate?

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.820
I really appreciate the brow
and the lash action on this.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.653
- Yeah.
- 'Cause I really

00:02:54.653 --> 00:02:56.532
made an effort today.
- Yeah.

00:02:56.532 --> 00:02:59.115
(Kedar laughs)

00:03:00.352 --> 00:03:01.460
- Why, I mean,

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.293
to be honest.

00:03:02.293 --> 00:03:03.126
- I'm disappointed.

00:03:04.006 --> 00:03:06.080
Can you talk me through that?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:06.927
I mean, it's uncanny.

00:03:06.927 --> 00:03:09.643
- That's not me, (laughs)
why is my chin so sharp?

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.982
- Okay, the chin was a little off.

00:03:11.982 --> 00:03:13.093
- I'll cut someone.
- And the neck's

00:03:13.093 --> 00:03:15.260
a little skinny.
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.110
Fucking hell, who is that?

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.003
- I'm not mad.

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.250
I'm not mad.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.260
You've got the mustache there,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.148
you've got the luscious lips there.

00:03:24.148 --> 00:03:27.093
(lips smacking)

00:03:27.093 --> 00:03:29.180
And my eyebrows are all right.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.580
Hold on, let me just fix it.

00:03:33.747 --> 00:03:35.111
- Oh my god.

00:03:35.111 --> 00:03:36.803
You've made me haggard.

00:03:36.803 --> 00:03:39.283
I look like--
- No, these are cheekbone.

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:41.463
Cheekbones.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.450
- Eat your heart out, "Art Attack."

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.210
- Connor and Kedar.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:50.570
- Thanks for watching.
(Ncuti laughs)

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.073
- Should we start an art show?

00:03:52.073 --> 00:03:53.640
- Yeah.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.431
But, yeah, we'll have pencils.

00:03:55.431 --> 00:03:56.598
- [Emma] Yeah.

